##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.0
# Rolling Teapot pieces as Catmull-Clark subdivision meshes: polySurface30
# (3,486 faces, open boundaries, mixed quads and triangles) and polySurface230
# (1,800 faces, closed). Each is above the ~2,000-face size that crashed
# CSubdivMesh::buildSurfaces (GitHub #194).
# Model by Brice Laville. Concept by Tom Robinson - RenderMan "Rolling Teapot" Art Challenge
# License: CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
# Source: https://renderman.pixar.com/rolling-teapot (rolling_Teapot.obj). Changed from the
# original: two of its 238 meshes, converted from OBJ polygons to SubdivisionMesh, UVs as
# facevarying st (t = 1 - v), normals dropped.
